WEBVTT

1
00:00:04.400 --> 00:00:09.230
Maya (AI): Good evening, Four2Labs. This is Maya. How can I help?

2
00:00:09.980 --> 00:00:15.920
Caller: Hi. I found you online. We're looking at AI for our phone calls, but I'm not really sure where to start.

3
00:00:16.430 --> 00:00:20.520
Maya (AI): Would you like me to book a short call with the team to look at your setup?

4
00:00:20.670 --> 00:00:22.670
Caller: Yeah, sure.

5
00:00:22.820 --> 00:00:25.970
Maya (AI): I have tomorrow at ten thirty, or three PM.

6
00:00:26.420 --> 00:00:28.420
Caller: Ten thirty should be fine.

7
00:00:28.570 --> 00:00:30.570
Caller: Actually, make it three.

8
00:00:30.720 --> 00:00:32.720
Maya (AI): Three PM works.

9
00:00:33.330 --> 00:00:37.900
Maya (AI): You're booked for three PM tomorrow. I'll send the confirmation now.

10
00:00:42.650 --> 00:00:49.740
Four2Labs builds AI voice systems that answer customers, understand your business, and take action.

11
00:00:51.120 --> 00:00:53.340
Four2Labs.

12
00:00:53.490 --> 00:00:57.680
Your business keeps answering, even when you can't.
